1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:05,800
Following a relaxing morning in our hotel, we decided to take the local bus to Mdina.
在酒店度过一个轻松的早晨后，我们决定坐当地公交去姆迪纳。

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:10,110
So this is probably a good time to discuss Maltese transport options.
现在正好聊聊马耳他的交通选择。

3
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:13,630
Ultimately the best way to get around the island is to hire a car.
按作者这次的感受，租车是环岛游玩最方便的方式。

4
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:25,950
If, like us however, you've been put off from driving abroad before, see our video from Tuscany, we actually found the bus system to be pretty reliable, but with a few notable pros and cons.
不过，如果像我们一样对在国外开车有顾虑，也可以坐公交；这次感觉还算可靠，只是有些明显优缺点。

5
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:31,559
Depending on the route, buses can arrive every 10, 30 or even 60 minutes apart.
片中说，不同线路的间隔可能是十分钟、半小时，甚至一小时。

6
00:00:31,559 --> 00:00:38,110
But we were able to get everywhere we wanted with only one change plus a bit of downtime in between.
不过他们想去的地方基本只需换乘一次，中间再等一会儿。

7
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:40,840
Google Maps obviously made everything a lot easier.
地图导航让这一切轻松多了。

8
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:47,920
And the super cheap price of only two euros for any bus taken within a two hour window made things mighty affordable.
按原片当时的票价，两小时内的公交只需两欧元，出行开销很低。

9
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:56,830
Sliema did have surprisingly good bus connections to most places we looked into, but obviously Valletta is much more connected overall.
斯利马到他们查过的大多数地方，公交连接都意外方便，不过瓦莱塔整体连接更多。

10
00:00:56,840 --> 00:01:07,759
And do keep an eye out on the last bus home time, with it leaving Mdina around 8 pm It did unfortunately mean we weren't able to attend that late night hardcore rave.
还得注意末班车；他们那次约晚上八点就要离开，所以没能参加所谓的深夜狂欢。

11
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:18,599
Mdina is a fortified city and a previous capital of Malta, with its history spanning 4,000 years.
片中介绍，姆迪纳是一座有城墙的古城，也曾是马耳他的首府，历史久远。

12
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:31,030
It's been dubbed the Silent City and has become a perfect time capsule that speaks for itself.
它有寂静之城的称呼，像一枚让历史自己说话的时间胶囊。

13
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:56,510
As the day started to wrap itself up, conversation turned to how to spend our final day here.
一天快结束时，我们开始商量最后一天怎么安排。

14
00:01:56,520 --> 00:02:02,120
This was the only time in the trip where not having the convenience of a car slightly affected our plans.
这也是整趟旅行里，没车的确稍微影响安排的一次。

15
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:12,510
Two items at the top of our list were Gozo and the Blue Lagoon, both very popular day trips, both on another island and both with very long travel times.
最想去的有戈佐岛和蓝潟湖，都是受欢迎的一日游目的地，但在别的岛上，路程也长。

16
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:16,919
If we had an extra day, we would certainly have done at least one of these excursions.
如果多一天，他们肯定会选其中一个短途行程。

17
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:25,400
After Malta we were actually flying to Santorini for four days, so the idea of having two travel heavy days in a row just didn't appeal to us.
离开马耳他后还要飞圣托里尼玩四天，所以不想连续两天都赶路。

18
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:32,240
As it happens however, the trip we did decide on turned out to be my favorite part of our entire Malta experience.
不过，最后选的行程，反而成了整趟马耳他旅行最喜欢的一部分。

19
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:41,789
In 2017 Malta unfortunately lost its famous Azure Window due to a heavy storm.
原片提到，马耳他著名的蓝窗在二〇一七年的风暴中消失了。

20
00:02:41,799 --> 00:02:51,789
Being one of the poster shots for the country, it was a terrible blow, but as we discovered there are still plenty of amazing geographical wonders to be found.
那曾是当地的标志性风景，消失令人惋惜，但他们发现，仍有许多令人赞叹的自然奇观。

21
00:02:51,799 --> 00:02:58,110
The Blue Grotto is popular with both scuba divers as well as those wanting to take it all in by boat.
蓝洞既吸引潜水爱好者，也吸引坐船欣赏海景的游客。

22
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:05,229
It is advisable to check ahead with your hotel that the boats are definitely running and that rough waters won't get in your way.
作者建议提前向酒店确认船是否运行，免得遇上风浪影响行程。

23
00:03:05,239 --> 00:03:14,720
Tickets were only 8 euros and put you up close and personal with this impressive rock formation and the incredibly clear blue waters below.
按他们那次的票价，八欧元就能近距离欣赏岩石构造和下方清澈的蓝色海水。
